    {
      "id": "35091201aa76",
      "name": "hermes-dreams",
      "prompt": "You are running the dreams memory consolidation cron job. Execute the following:\n\n1. Read ~/.hermes/.last-dream (timestamp file). If it exists and is less than 24 hours old (86400 seconds), print \"SKIP: $(cat ~/.hermes/.last-dream) \u2014 less than 24h since last dream\" and exit.\n\n2. If 24+ hours since last dream (or first run with no .last-dream file), run the full 4-phase consolidation:\n\nPHASE 1 \u2014 ORIENT:\n- Read ~/.hermes/memories/MEMORY.md and ~/.hermes/memories/USER.md. Note: line counts, relative dates, stale entries, contradictions.\n- List recent sessions: find ~/.hermes/sessions/ -name \"*.jsonl\" -mtime -7 | sort | tail -20\n\nPHASE 2 \u2014 GATHER SIGNAL:\nUse grep on the recent JSONL session files (as user messages only \u2014 look for \"role\":\"user\" lines) to find:\n- Corrections: \"actually\", \"no,\", \"wrong\", \"stop doing\", \"don't do\", \"I said\", \"I meant\", \"that's not\", \"correction\", \"remember that\", \"don't forget\"\n- Preferences: \"I prefer\", \"I like\", \"I don't like\", \"I want\", \"from now on\", \"always use\", \"never use\"\n- Decisions: \"let's go with\", \"I decided\", \"we're using\", \"the plan is\", \"switch to\", \"decision\", \"we agreed\"\n- Patterns: \"again\", \"every time\", \"keep forgetting\", \"as usual\", \"same as before\", \"like last time\", \"we always\"\n\nFor each match, note the session file (mtime = session date), the content, and whether it contradicts current memory.\n\nPHASE 3 \u2014 CONSOLIDATE:\nFor each finding from Phase 2:\n- If NEW fact not in memory \u2192 add it using the write_file tool (patch MEMORY.md or USER.md)\n- If CONTRADICTS existing entry \u2192 replace the old entry, note \"(Updated YYYY-MM-DD, previously: ...)\"\n- If DUPLICATE \u2192 skip\n- Convert any relative dates to absolute using the session file mtime\n- Use format: \"- [YYYY-MM-DD] The fact or preference. (source: session, confidence: high/medium)\"\n\nPHASE 4 \u2014 PRUNE & INDEX:\n- Check MEMORY.md is under 2200 chars. If over, trim oldest/lowest-priority entries.\n- Remove entries contradicted in Phase 3\n- Remove entries with relative dates (\"yesterday\", \"last week\", etc.)\n- Verify all referenced topic files exist\n- Write timestamp: echo $(date +%s) > ~/.hermes/.last-dream\n\nVERIFICATION:\n- Confirm .last-dream was written\n- Count: entries added, updated, removed, contradictions resolved\n- Print a 1-line summary of what was changed\n\nDeliver the summary only if changes were made. If nothing needed changing, print \"No changes needed \u2014 memory is clean.\"",
